t\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">16.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">50,000 - 500,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20151112143148&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Homecoming_a90c2e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  boots of homecoming <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:2)</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 100 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 16.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">They are made of dark red buckskin and the golden clasps look like the letter F.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When used inside of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Zone\">protection zone</a>, they will teleport you in front of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Citadel\">Ferumbras Citadel</a> found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32121,32708,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32121, 32708, 7)</a> and the text will appear:<br/>\n<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Magical sparks whirl around the boots and suddenly you are somewhere else.</span><br/>\n</p><p>If you do not meet the criteria to be able to <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleport</a> using these boots, the message below will appear, accompanied by two graphical effects: red sparkles overlaid with an explosion effect, both displayed ontop your character.<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Some magical sparks blaze up and die out immediately. There is an energy barrier somewhere that you cannot pass yet.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Explosion Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Explosion_Effect_3c82ff.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Red Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Sparkles_Effect_d3661b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p><p>These boots have a 24-hour cooldown period and lack a visible indication of their charge status. The easiest method to confirm their readiness for teleportation (when not on cooldown) is to maintain them in a 'charged' state on your <a href=\"#/wiki/Action%20Bars\">action bar</a>. Alternatively, if not pre-set on an action bar, you can ascertain their charge by placing them in your depot and checking <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">The Market</a>, as only boots that are charged can be sold on the market.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell\">Ferumbras Mortal Shell</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Boots of Homecoming (Used)</li><li>Bosses</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell\">Ferumbras Mortal Shell</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li>Sorcerers</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">The Market (Object)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">The Shattered Isles Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-shattered-isles-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-shattered-isles-quest","quest":"The Shattered Isles Quest","step":"10-3","n":50,"title":"Voltar à Ferumbras Citadel","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33176,"y":31764,"z":6,"label":"Captain Seahorse (porto de Edron)"},{"x":32024,"y":32734,"z":7,"label":"Alçapão para Kharos"}]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Ferumbras Mortal Shell","pct":10.828,"qty":"1","rarity":"pouco comum","hp":"300,000","exp":"2,000,000","loc":"Halls of Ascension .","places":[{"name":"Halls of Ascension","x":33304,"y":31460,"z":12,"href":"#/wiki/Halls%20of%20Ascension"}],"href":"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell"}],"spots":[{"x":32121,"y":32708,"z":7,"text":"When used inside of a protection zone , they will teleport you in front of the Ferumbras Citadel found here and the text will appear: Magical sparks whirl around the boots and suddenly you are somewhere else."}]}}